      "updated_at": "2020-02-20T10:34:34Z",
      "body": "Note that the `Usage and technical data, Marketing data and Experiments` are now displayed on the `Data collection` section in settings.\r\nThe toggles are working correctly, @boek should be verified the functionalities too for this bug?\r\nI can toggle ON and OFF but how I will know for sure that the information is sent or not correct?\r\nIf only the verification that the options are added and can be turned on and off is enough I will close this bug.\r\nI will remove the `eng:qa:needed` until further notice.",
